Package: devjam-archive-keyring
Version: 1.42-3
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Signing key for the dev-jam apt repository
 OpenPGP key that signs the dev-jam apt repository
 (https://dev-jam.github.io/debian/), installed in /usr/share/keyrings
 for use with Signed-By in deb822 .sources files.
